\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014577\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"12790418-6492-492a-814c-53673bc1ab1a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008189\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009281\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008191\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007702\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008791\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008792\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017357\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017358\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017359\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017360\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017361\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMember